    id: 1,
    title: 'How can I make reservations?',
    content:
      'Visit our reservations section or our in-app chat for live seating. Bookings are confirmed instantly and saved to your profile.',
    isOpen: false,
  },
  {
    id: 2,
    title: 'What are the hours for the wine list?',
    content:
      'Our sommelier-curated wine list is available for tasting and pairing throughout dinner hours. Tastings are complimentary with an order.',
    isOpen: false,
  },
  {
    id: 3,
    title: 'Do you have gluten-free options?',
    content:
      'Yes, we have a dedicated gluten-free pizza crust and a selection of gluten-free pasta dishes. Please inform your server.',
    isOpen: false,
  },
  {
    id: 4,
    title: 'Are there outdoor seating areas?',
    content:
      'Yes, we have a charming outdoor terrace with seating for both dining and cocktail service. Reservations recommended, especially on weekends.',
